{
"volume":"二上",
"topics":{"m2a.1.1":{"description":"按给定的标准给物体分类，分类结果与标准一一对应；同一批物体按同一标准分类，结果是确定的。","mastery_criteria":["能按给定标准把物体分到相应类别","能说出分类的标准是什么"],"type":"conceptual","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.SP.01","confidence":"exact"}],"root_reason":"小学统计分支的起点：第一次系统地把物体按标准分类，此前只有零散的比较。"},"m2a.1.2":{"description":"分类标准可以自己选定，如按颜色、形状、大小、用途等；标准不同，分出的结果也不同。","mastery_criteria":["能自选标准对物体分类","能说出换一个标准后结果为何变化"],"type":"conceptual","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.SP.01","confidence":"exact"}]},"m2a.1.3":{"description":"逐层分类是在第一次分类的基础上，对每一类再按另一个标准继续分类，得到更细的类别。","mastery_criteria":["能对已分的类再按新标准细分","能说出逐层分类后的类别数"],"type":"procedural","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.SP.01","confidence":"inferred"}]},"m2a.2.1":{"description":"求几个相同加数的和，可以用乘法计算；乘法是加法的简便运算，算式中的两个数叫乘数，结果叫积。","mastery_criteria":["能把相同加数的连加改写成乘法","能说出乘法算式中各部分的名称"],"type":"conceptual","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.NA.02","confidence":"exact"}]},"m2a.2.2":{"description":"5 的乘法口诀共五句，一五得五、二五一十……五五二十五；相邻两句的积相差 5。","mastery_criteria":["能背诵 5 的乘法口诀","能用 5 的口诀计算乘法与相应的除法"],"type":"procedural","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.NA.02","confidence":"exact"}]},"m2a.2.3":{"description":"2、3、4 的乘法口诀按“几几得几”编排，积不满十的加“得”字；口诀可以正用算乘法、反用算除法。","mastery_criteria":["能背诵 2、3、4 的乘法口诀","能用口诀计算相应的乘除法"],"type":"procedural","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.NA.02","confidence":"exact"}]},"m2a.2.4":{"description":"乘加、乘减混合运算要先算乘法，再算加减；乘减可以理解为“几个几少几”。","mastery_criteria":["能按先乘后加减的顺序计算","能把乘加乘减算式与情境对应起来"],"type":"procedural","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.NA.02","confidence":"exact"}]},"m2a.2.5":{"description":"6 的乘法口诀共六句，相邻两句的积相差 6；用口诀可以算 6 的乘法与相应的除法。","mastery_criteria":["能背诵 6 的乘法口诀","能用 6 的口诀求积与求商"],"type":"procedural","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.NA.02","confidence":"exact"}]},"m2a.2.6":{"description":"解决问题时要先判断数量关系：求几个相同加数的和用乘法，求合并或剩余用加减法。","mastery_criteria":["能判断该用哪种运算","能说明选择该运算的理由"],"type":"application","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.NA.03","confidence":"exact"}]},"m2a.2.7":{"description":"购物问题中，单价×数量=总价；已知单价和数量用乘法求总价。","mastery_criteria":["能用乘法求总价","能说清单价、数量与总价的关系"],"type":"application","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.NA.03","confidence":"exact"}]},"m2a.3.1":{"description":"“包含分”是按每份的个数一份一份地分，看总数里包含几个这样的份；结果是份数。","mastery_criteria":["能按每份个数进行包含分","能说出包含分的结果是份数"],"type":"conceptual","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.NA.02","confidence":"exact"}]},"m2a.3.2":{"description":"“等分”是把总数平均分成指定的几份，求每份是多少；结果是每份的个数。","mastery_criteria":["能把总数平均分成若干份","能说出等分的结果是每份个数"],"type":"conceptual","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.NA.02","confidence":"exact"}]},"m2a.3.3":{"description":"把一些物体每几个一份地分，求分成的份数，用除法计算；算式读作“几除以几等于几”。","mastery_criteria":["能把包含分写成除法算式","能正确读出除法算式"],"type":"procedural","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.NA.02","confidence":"exact"}]},"m2a.3.4":{"description":"把一个数平均分成几份求每份是多少，也用除法；算式中被除数、除数、商各有名称。","mastery_criteria":["能把等分写成除法算式","能说出被除数、除数、商的名称"],"type":"procedural","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.NA.02","confidence":"exact"}]},"m2a.3.5":{"description":"用 2～6 的乘法口诀求商：想“几乘除数得被除数”，商就是那个数。","mastery_criteria":["能用乘法口诀求商","能说清“想乘算除”的思路"],"type":"procedural","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.NA.02","confidence":"exact"}]},"m2a.3.6":{"description":"被除数较大时，仍用乘法口诀求商，但要准确选择含除数的口诀，并注意积与被除数一致。","mastery_criteria":["能熟练用口诀求商","能检查商与除数的积是否等于被除数"],"type":"procedural","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.NA.02","confidence":"exact"}]},"m2a.3.7":{"description":"除法可以解决“平均分给几人”“每几个一份”两类实际问题，关键分清求的是每份数还是份数。","mastery_criteria":["能判断除法问题求的是每份数还是份数","能列式解答并说明结果含义"],"type":"application","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.NA.03","confidence":"exact"}]},"m2a.4.1":{"description":"厘米是较小的长度单位，用尺子量长度时要把 0 刻度对准物体一端；1 米=100 厘米。","mastery_criteria":["能用厘米作单位量物体长度","知道 1 米=100 厘米"],"type":"procedural","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.GE.01","confidence":"exact"}]},"m2a.4.2":{"description":"米是较大的长度单位，量较长的物体用米；1 米=100 厘米，米与厘米之间可以换算。","mastery_criteria":["能选择米或厘米作单位","能进行米与厘米的换算"],"type":"procedural","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.GE.01","confidence":"exact"}]},"m2a.4.3":{"description":"线段是直的、有两个端点，可以量出长度；直线没有端点，射线只有一个端点，都不能量出长度。","mastery_criteria":["能识别线段并说出它的两个特征","能比较线段与直线、射线的区别"],"type":"conceptual","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.GE.01","confidence":"exact"}]},"m2a.4.4":{"description":"估测是借助熟悉的长度作参照来估计物体长度，如课桌高约 70 厘米、一步约 50 厘米。","mastery_criteria":["能借助参照物估测长度","能判断估测结果是否合理"],"type":"application","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.GE.01","confidence":"inferred"}]},"m2a.5.1":{"description":"7 的乘法口诀共七句，相邻两句的积相差 7；可用“三七二十一”等口诀算积与求商。","mastery_criteria":["能背诵 7 的乘法口诀","能用 7 的口诀求积与求商"],"type":"procedural","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.NA.02","confidence":"exact"}]},"m2a.5.2":{"description":"8 的乘法口诀共八句，相邻两句的积相差 8；口诀同样可以正用求积、反用求商。","mastery_criteria":["能背诵 8 的乘法口诀","能用 8 的口诀求积与求商"],"type":"procedural","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.NA.02","confidence":"exact"}]},"m2a.5.3":{"description":"9 的乘法口诀共九句，积的十位与个位数字之和多为 9；相邻两句的积相差 9。","mastery_criteria":["能背诵 9 的乘法口诀","能发现 9 的口诀中积的规律"],"type":"procedural","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.NA.02","confidence":"exact"}]},"m2a.5.4":{"description":"用 7、8 的乘法口诀求商，想“几乘 7（或 8）得被除数”，商即为所求。","mastery_criteria":["能用 7、8 的口诀求商","能用乘法检查除法结果"],"type":"procedural","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.NA.02","confidence":"exact"}]},"m2a.5.5":{"description":"用 9 的乘法口诀求商，同样是想乘法算除法；注意 9 的口诀积较大，容易混淆。","mastery_criteria":["能用 9 的口诀求商","能区分相近的两句口诀"],"type":"procedural","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.NA.02","confidence":"exact"}]},"m2a.5.6":{"description":"连续两问的问题，第二问要用到第一问的结果；先算第一问，再把结果作为条件算第二问。","mastery_criteria":["能按顺序解答连续两问","能把前一问的结果用于后一问"],"type":"application","standards":[{"id":"cms-2022:1.NA.03","confidence":"exact"}]}},
"dependencies":[{"topicId":"m2a.1.2","prerequisiteId":"m2a.1.1","strength":"hard","reason":"先会按给定标准分类，才能自选标准。"},{"topicId":"m2a.1.3","prerequisiteId":"m2a.1.2","strength":"hard","reason":"逐层分类要在已有一次分类结果上继续。"},{"topicId":"m2a.2.1","prerequisiteId":"m1a.1.5","strength":"hard","reason":"乘法是相同加数连加的简便运算，先掌握加法。"},{"topicId":"m2a.2.2","prerequisiteId":"m2a.2.1","strength":"hard","reason":"先理解乘法的意义，再记口诀。"},{"topicId":"m2a.2.3","prerequisiteId":"m2a.2.2","strength":"soft","reason":"2、3、4 的口诀可与 5 的口诀对照编排记忆。"},{"topicId":"m2a.2.4","prerequisiteId":"m2a.2.3","strength":"hard","reason":"乘加乘减要先会用口诀算乘法。"},{"topicId":"m2a.2.5","prerequisiteId":"m2a.2.3","strength":"hard","reason":"6 的口诀延续 2～5 的口诀编排方式。"},{"topicId":"m2a.2.6","prerequisiteId":"m2a.2.4","strength":"hard","reason":"选择运算要先能处理乘加乘减这类复合情境。"},{"topicId":"m2a.2.7","prerequisiteId":"m2a.2.5","strength":"hard","reason":"购物问题要用 6 以内的口诀计算总价。"},{"topicId":"m2a.3.1","prerequisiteId":"m2a.2.1","strength":"soft","reason":"平均分是“几个几”的逆向操作，与乘法意义相关。"},{"topicId":"m2a.3.2","prerequisiteId":"m2a.3.1","strength":"hard","reason":"先学包含分，再学等分，两种分法需要对照区分。"},{"topicId":"m2a.3.3","prerequisiteId":"m2a.3.1","strength":"hard","reason":"包含分的算式建立在包含分的操作之上。"},{"topicId":"m2a.3.4","prerequisiteId":"m2a.3.2","strength":"hard","reason":"等分的算式建立在等分的操作之上。"},{"topicId":"m2a.3.5","prerequisiteId":"m2a.3.3","strength":"hard","reason":"求商要先理解除法算式的含义。"},{"topicId":"m2a.3.5","prerequisiteId":"m2a.2.5","strength":"soft","reason":"求商要借助 2～6 的乘法口诀。"},{"topicId":"m2a.3.6","prerequisiteId":"m2a.3.4","strength":"hard","reason":"等分情境下的求商同样要用除法算式。"},{"topicId":"m2a.3.6","prerequisiteId":"m2a.2.5","strength":"soft","reason":"求商依赖乘法口诀的熟练程度。"},{"topicId":"m2a.3.7","prerequisiteId":"m2a.3.5","strength":"hard","reason":"解决除法问题要会求商。"},{"topicId":"m2a.3.7","prerequisiteId":"m2a.3.6","strength":"soft","reason":"两类除法问题要能区分。"},{"topicId":"m2a.4.1","prerequisiteId":"m1b.3.1","strength":"soft","reason":"测量结果要用 100 以内的数表示。"},{"topicId":"m2a.4.2","prerequisiteId":"m2a.4.1","strength":"hard","reason":"米与厘米的换算建立在认识厘米的基础上。"},{"topicId":"m2a.4.3","prerequisiteId":"m2a.4.1","strength":"hard","reason":"量线段长度要用厘米刻度。"},{"topicId":"m2a.4.4","prerequisiteId":"m2a.4.2","strength":"hard","reason":"估测要有米和厘米的长度观念。"},{"topicId":"m2a.5.1","prerequisiteId":"m2a.2.5","strength":"hard","reason":"7 的口诀接在 6 的口诀之后，按顺序学习。"},{"topicId":"m2a.5.2","prerequisiteId":"m2a.5.1","strength":"hard","reason":"8 的口诀在 7 的口诀基础上继续。"},{"topicId":"m2a.5.3","prerequisiteId":"m2a.5.2","strength":"hard","reason":"9 的口诀在 8 的口诀基础上继续。"},{"topicId":"m2a.5.4","prerequisiteId":"m2a.5.1","strength":"hard","reason":"用 7 的口诀求商要先记住 7 的口诀。"},{"topicId":"m2a.5.4","prerequisiteId":"m2a.3.5","strength":"soft","reason":"求商方法在 2～6 时已经建立。"},{"topicId":"m2a.5.5","prerequisiteId":"m2a.5.3","strength":"hard","reason":"用 9 的口诀求商要先记住 9 的口诀。"},{"topicId":"m2a.5.5","prerequisiteId":"m2a.3.6","strength":"soft","reason":"求商技能可迁移。"},{"topicId":"m2a.5.6","prerequisiteId":"m2a.5.4","strength":"hard","reason":"连续两问常用乘除混合，需要熟练求积求商。"},{"topicId":"m2a.5.6","prerequisiteId":"m2a.5.5","strength":"soft","reason":"第二问可能用到 9 的口诀。"}],
"questions":[
{"id":"m2a.1.1-q1","topicId":"m2a.1.1","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"苹果、香蕉、橘子放在一起，按“是不是水果”分类，它们都属于哪一类？","answer":"o2","explanation":"苹果、香蕉、橘子都属于水果。","choices":[{"id":"o1","text":"文具"},{"id":"o2","text":"水果"},{"id":"o3","text":"蔬菜"}]},
{"id":"m2a.1.1-q2","topicId":"m2a.1.1","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"图形按颜色分类，红色 5 个、蓝色 3 个，红色比蓝色多几个？（只填数字）","answer":"2","verify":"5-3","explanation":"5-3=2，红色比蓝色多 2 个。"},
{"id":"m2a.1.2-q1","topicId":"m2a.1.2","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"下列哪一项完整列出了给扣子分类可以用的三种标准？","answer":"o2","explanation":"大小、颜色、形状都可以作为扣子的分类标准，所以完整列出三种标准的是「大小、颜色、形状都可以」。原题的「以上都可以」按字面只覆盖它前面的一项，而且三个单项也都成立，单选不唯一。","choices":[{"id":"o1","text":"大小"},{"id":"o2","text":"大小、颜色、形状都可以"},{"id":"o3","text":"颜色"},{"id":"o4","text":"形状"}]},
{"id":"m2a.1.2-q2","topicId":"m2a.1.2","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"同一堆物品按不同标准分类，结果会怎样？","answer":"o3","explanation":"标准变了，分出的类别通常不同，也可能在某种情况下相同。","choices":[{"id":"o1","text":"一定不同"},{"id":"o2","text":"一定相同"},{"id":"o3","text":"可能不同"}]},
{"id":"m2a.1.3-q1","topicId":"m2a.1.3","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"先按颜色分成 2 类，再把每类按形状分成 2 类，一共分成几类？（只填数字）","answer":"4","verify":"2*2","explanation":"2×2=4，逐层分类的类别数是各层类别数相乘。"},
{"id":"m2a.1.3-q2","topicId":"m2a.1.3","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"逐层分类的好处是什么？","answer":"o1","explanation":"逐层分类让每一类的特征更明确，便于整理和分析。","choices":[{"id":"o1","text":"分得更细、更清楚"},{"id":"o2","text":"分得更快"},{"id":"o3","text":"东西变少了"}]},
{"id":"m2a.2.1-q1","topicId":"m2a.2.1","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"3+3+3+3 用乘法表示是 3×4，结果是多少？（只填数字）","answer":"12","verify":"3*4","explanation":"4 个 3 相加，3×4=12。"},
{"id":"m2a.2.1-q2","topicId":"m2a.2.1","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"5×2 表示什么意思？","answer":"o1","explanation":"5×2 表示 2 个 5 相加，即 5+5。","choices":[{"id":"o1","text":"2 个 5 相加"},{"id":"o2","text":"5 个 5 相加"},{"id":"o3","text":"5 和 2 相加"}]},
{"id":"m2a.2.2-q1","topicId":"m2a.2.2","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"5×3=？（只填数字）","answer":"15","verify":"5*3","explanation":"三五十五。"},
{"id":"m2a.2.2-q2","topicId":"m2a.2.2","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"5×5=？（只填数字）","answer":"25","verify":"5*5","explanation":"五五二十五。"},
{"id":"m2a.2.3-q1","topicId":"m2a.2.3","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"3×4=？（只填数字）","answer":"12","verify":"3*4","explanation":"三四十二。"},
{"id":"m2a.2.3-q2","topicId":"m2a.2.3","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"2×6=？（只填数字）","answer":"12","verify":"2*6","explanation":"二六十二。"},
{"id":"m2a.2.4-q1","topicId":"m2a.2.4","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"3×4+2=？（只填数字）","answer":"14","verify":"3*4+2","explanation":"先算乘法 3×4=12，再加 2 得 14。"},
{"id":"m2a.2.4-q2","topicId":"m2a.2.4","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"5×6-3=？（只填数字）","answer":"27","verify":"5*6-3","explanation":"先算 5×6=30，再减 3 得 27。"},
{"id":"m2a.2.5-q1","topicId":"m2a.2.5","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"6×7=？（只填数字）","answer":"42","verify":"6*7","explanation":"六七四十二。"},
{"id":"m2a.2.5-q2","topicId":"m2a.2.5","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"6×9=？（只填数字）","answer":"54","verify":"6*9","explanation":"六九五十四。"},
{"id":"m2a.2.6-q1","topicId":"m2a.2.6","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"有 4 排座位，每排 5 个，求一共有多少个座位，用什么方法最简便？","answer":"o3","explanation":"求 4 个 5 是多少，用乘法 4×5=20 最简便。","choices":[{"id":"o1","text":"减法"},{"id":"o2","text":"加法"},{"id":"o3","text":"乘法"}]},
{"id":"m2a.2.6-q2","topicId":"m2a.2.6","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"有 5 个盘子，每盘放 3 个苹果，求一共有几个，应列哪个算式？","answer":"o2","explanation":"5 个 3 相加，用乘法 5×3=15。","choices":[{"id":"o1","text":"5+3"},{"id":"o2","text":"5×3"},{"id":"o3","text":"5-3"}]},
{"id":"m2a.2.7-q1","topicId":"m2a.2.7","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"一支笔 3 元，买 4 支要多少钱？（只填数字）","answer":"12","verify":"3*4","explanation":"单价 3 元、数量 4 支，3×4=12 元。"},
{"id":"m2a.2.7-q2","topicId":"m2a.2.7","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"一个本子 2 元，买 6 个要多少钱？（只填数字）","answer":"12","verify":"2*6","explanation":"2×6=12 元。"},
{"id":"m2a.3.1-q1","topicId":"m2a.3.1","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"12 个苹果，每 3 个装一袋，可以装几袋？（只填数字）","answer":"4","verify":"12/3","explanation":"12 里面有几个 3，就能装几袋，12÷3=4。"},
{"id":"m2a.3.1-q2","topicId":"m2a.3.1","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"“每 4 个一份，能分几份”属于哪种分法？","answer":"o2","explanation":"按每份的个数一份一份地分，看能分出几份，是包含分。","choices":[{"id":"o1","text":"等分"},{"id":"o2","text":"包含分"}]},
{"id":"m2a.3.2-q1","topicId":"m2a.3.2","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"12 个苹果平均分给 3 人，每人几个？（只填数字）","answer":"4","verify":"12/3","explanation":"12 平均分成 3 份，每份 4 个。"},
